0    has the location of a symmetry file been provided?
-1    restriction on tree depth (-1 means none)
8    number of branching rules

0.20 use this rule when gap is worse than...
1    use this rule thru this depth. (the root, and depth 1 above 0.20: sko49.par's first block, which went to depth 2)
 9    branching rule at top of tree
 150  Frank-Wolfe iterations, for bound
 100  Frank-wolfe iterations, when we know we can't fathom
 25   Frank-Wolfe iterations, for row selection
 1    which bound?
 30   step for parametric bound
 30    compute B for best _ rows of U

0.12 use this rule when gap is worse than...
1    use this rule thru this depth. (depth 1 at 0.12-0.20: sko49.par's second block)
 9    branching rule at top of tree
 150  Frank-Wolfe iterations, for bound
 100  Frank-wolfe iterations, when we know we can't fathom
 12   Frank-Wolfe iterations, for row selection
 1    which bound?
 30   step for parametric bound
 3    compute B for best _ rows of U

0.12 use this rule when gap is worse than...
2    use this rule thru this depth. (depth 2 above 0.12)
 10   branching rule: every line, the size score on the children's QPB bounds
 150  Frank-Wolfe iterations, for bound
 100  Frank-wolfe iterations, when we know we can't fathom
 25   Frank-Wolfe iterations, for row selection (25: what ucheap/sko42sub measured)
 1    which bound?
 30   step for parametric bound
 99   compute B for best _ rows of U (rule 10: 99 = every row and column)

0.12 use this rule when gap is worse than...
4    use this rule thru this depth. (depths 3 and 4 above 0.12: sko49.par's second block, unchanged)
